        {
          "id": "326dcfd4-ee11-35c5-a24a-135833545666",
          "content": {
            "id": "326dcfd4-ee11-35c5-a24a-135833545666",
            "contentType": "STORY",
            "title": "Why Sanara MedTech (SMTI) Is Refocusing After Discontinuing THP Division and Reporting Quarterly Losses",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Sanara MedTech announced the discontinuation of its Tissue Health Plus (THP) division and reported third-quarter earnings, with sales reaching US$26.33 million and a net loss of US$30.41 million for the period ended September 30, 2025. This move marks a business realignment to concentrate on the core surgical segment, with management expecting THP wind-down costs to conclude by the end of 2025 and further resource shifts to support main operations. We\u2019ll explore how the decision to exit THP...",
